    {
      "source": "This implementation builds a URI based on the URL returned\nby <a href=\"AbstractResource.html#getURL()\"><code>AbstractResource.getURL()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此实现基于 `<a href=\"AbstractResource.html#getURL()\"><code>AbstractResource.getURL()</code></a>` 返回的 URL 构建 URI。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "As of Spring 4.0, this class supports VFS 3.x on JBoss AS 6+\n(package <code>org.jboss.vfs</code>) and is in particular compatible with\nJBoss AS 7 and WildFly 8+.",
      "translation": "自 Spring 4.0 起，该类支持 JBoss AS 6+ 上的 VFS 3.x（包 `<code>org.jboss.vfs</code>`），特别是与 JBoss AS 7 和 WildFly 8+ 兼容。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation always returns <code>true</code> for a resource\nthat <a href=\"AbstractResource.html#exists()\"><code>exists</code></a> (revised as of 5.1).",
      "translation": "此实现始终为存在（自 5.1 修订后）的资源返回 `<code>true</code>`，该资源通过 <a href=\"AbstractResource.html#exists()\"><code>exists</code></a> 进行检查。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from class: <code><a href=\"AbstractResource.html#getURL()\">AbstractResource</a></code></span>",
