    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from class: <code><a href=\"AbstractResource.html#getFile()\">AbstractResource</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从类复制：<code><a href=\"AbstractResource.html#getFile()\">AbstractResource</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>VfsResource</code> wrapping the given resource handle.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<code>VfsResource</code>来包装给定的资源句柄。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation always returns <code>null</code>,\nassuming that this resource type does not have a filename.",
      "translation": "此实现始终返回<code>null</code>，假定该资源类型没有文件名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation throws a FileNotFoundException, assuming\nthat relative resources cannot be created for this resource.",
      "translation": "此实现会抛出 FileNotFoundException，假设无法为此资源创建相对资源。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation compares description strings.",
      "translation": "此实现比较描述字符串。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation throws a FileNotFoundException, assuming\nthat the resource cannot be resolved to an absolute file path.",
      "translation": "此实现会抛出 FileNotFoundException，假定该资源无法解析为绝对文件路径。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation throws a FileNotFoundException, assuming\nthat the resource cannot be resolved to a URL.",
      "translation": "此实现会抛出 FileNotFoundException，假设该资源无法解析为 URL。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation returns the description's hash code.",
      "translation": "此实现返回描述的哈希码。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation checks the timestamp of the underlying File,\nif available.",
      "translation": "此实现会检查底层文件的戳记（如果可用）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>resource</code> - a <code>org.jboss.vfs.VirtualFile</code> instance\n(untyped in order to avoid a static dependency on the VFS API)",
      "translation": "<code>resource</code> - 一个 `org.jboss.vfs.VirtualFile` 实例（未指定类型以避免对 VFS API 产生静态依赖）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/IOException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\">IOException</a></code> - if the resource cannot be resolved\n(in the file system or as some other known physical resource type)",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/IOException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\">IOException</a></code> - 如果无法解析资源（在文件系统中或作为其他已知的物理资源类型）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Ales Justin, Juergen Hoeller, Costin Leau, Sam Brannen",
      "translation": "Ales Justin, Juergen Hoeller, Costin Leau, Sam Brannen",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This requirement is particularly important when you consider an API such\nas JavaMail, which needs to be able to read the stream multiple times when\ncreating mail attachments. For such a use case, it is <i>required</i>\nthat each <code>getInputStream()</code> call returns a fresh stream.",
      "translation": "此要求在考虑像 JavaMail 这样的 API 时尤为重要，因为该 API 在创建邮件附件时需要多次读取流。对于此类用例，每个 `<code>getInputStream()</code>` 调用必须返回一个全新的流。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "It is usually expected that every such call creates a <i>fresh</i> stream.",
      "translation": "通常期望每次这样的调用都会创建一个<i>新的</i>流。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "For a custom subclass of <code>InputStreamResource</code>, we strongly\nrecommend overriding this method with a more optimal implementation, for example,\nchecking File length, or possibly simply returning -1 if the stream can\nonly be read once.",
      "translation": "对于 `<code>InputStreamResource`</code> 的自定义子类，我们强烈建议通过更优化的实现来重写此方法，例如检查文件长度，或者如果流只能读取一次则直接返回 -1。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementations are also encouraged to return this value\nfrom their <code>toString</code> method.",
      "translation": "实现也鼓励从其<code>toString</code>方法返回此值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This will cover both directories and content resources.",
      "translation": "这将同时涵盖目录和内容资源。",
      "count": 1
    },
